1
00:00:00,033 --> 00:00:01,752
My favorite fruit is watermelon
我最喜欢的水果是西瓜

2
00:00:01,752 --> 00:00:02,746
In the summer
在夏天

3
00:00:02,793 --> 00:00:04,706
my mom buys a big watermelon
我妈妈买了一个大西瓜

4
00:00:05,073 --> 00:00:07,266
We cut the watermelon into small pieces
我们把西瓜切成小块

5
00:00:07,432 --> 00:00:08,992
The color of the watermelon is red
西瓜的颜色是红色的

6
00:00:08,993 --> 00:00:11,105
and it has many black seeds inside
而且里面有很多黑色的种子

7
00:00:11,512 --> 00:00:12,672
I Like to eat watermelon
我喜欢吃西瓜

8
00:00:12,673 --> 00:00:15,025
because it is very sweet and juicy
因为它非常甜和多汁

9
00:00:15,189 --> 00:00:15,785
Sometimes
有时

10
00:00:15,785 --> 00:00:19,146
I eat watermelon with my friends and we see who can eat the fastest
我和我的朋友一起吃西瓜看谁吃得最快

11
00:00:19,393 --> 00:00:21,343
Eating watermelon is a happy thing!
吃西瓜是一件快乐的事！

